window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>LILITH</b></p> <p>He's excruciatingly handsome, and well, fine as hell. He's also my captor. He won't take his eyes off me. He won't let me go.</p> <p>All I can do is hope he'll let me live.</p> <p><b>RAY</b></p> <p>She's beautiful, but she doesn't understand me. She doesn't seem to grasp that things have to be this way.</p> <p>She has to be mine. And if she isn't mine? Well, she will die.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
